_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-26T00:10:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T00:10:56Z","body":"I've updated the PR to silence the error about no renders being available if the binary is running in headless mode.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2683571183/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958950568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103100#issuecomment-2958950568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103100","id":2958950568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wXgCo","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T12:06:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T12:45:50Z","body":"I'm not too familiar with renderers and buildsystems, but I tested this on my Godot project (GodSVG) which is already highly stripped down, and figured that a benchmark like this might be useful.\r\n\r\n## Godot 4.5.dev5\r\n\r\nMy build options are: `target=template_release lto=full production=yes deprecated=no minizip=no brotli=no vulkan=no use_volk=no disable_3d=yes disable_physics_2d=yes disable_navigation_2d=yes modules_enabled_by_default=no module_freetype_enabled=yes module_gdscript_enabled=yes module_svg_enabled=yes module_jpg_enabled=yes module_text_server_adv_enabled=yes graphite=no module_webp_enabled=yes module_mbedtls_enabled=yes build_profile=../godsvg/.github/disabled_classes.build`\r\n\r\nWeb is compiled with `threads=no`.\r\n\r\n- On Linux, the zip I got was 14.3 MB, the executable was 36 MB. Compiled in 11 minutes.\r\n- On Web, the zip I got was 6.32 MB, the wasm 19.1 MB. Compiled in 16.5 minutes.\r\n\r\n## This PR\r\n\r\nI added `rendering_device=no`. I also tried adding `forward_plus_renderer=no` and `forward_mobile_renderer=no`, but that didn't change anything. Let me know if I've done something wrong, but I assume just disabling rendering_device disables these too.\r\n\r\n- On Linux, the zip I got was 13.9 MB (-3%), the executable was 34.7 MB (-3.5%). Compiled in 10 minutes.\r\n- On Web, the zip I got was 6.15 MB (-2.5%), the wasm was 18.2 MB (-5%). Compiled in 15 minutes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958950568/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":6,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":